    "title": "Artizen pauses operations, tells users to claim payouts or withdraw funds",
    "summary": "Artizen's operational pause raises concerns about the future of community-funded projects and the stability of ART token investments.\nThe post Artizen pauses operations, tells users to claim payouts or withdraw funds appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
